{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4121600/extras/c7fdec61a70d989dec00dbd6c5357b65.avif?t=1761589011\" width=461 height=251 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>The Beautiful World of Psychopomp Returns</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You awaken in the desert. A strange dog has told you the world will end in three days. Massive rusting structures of death pierce into the night sky, brimming with untold horrors. The blood red planet above is only getting closer. It all falls on your head. Always.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An ancient voice calls to you, screaming from the depths of the Earth, and wailing from above.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Psychopomp 2</strong> is a strange and otherworldly horror-action-adventure game. Explore dark mechanical dungeons, and battle the monstrosities within. Use quick wits and reflexes to avoid their gnashing attacks and strike back!\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4121600/extras/7fb159fcf9d71f07a19599c8b96c68ec.poster.avif?t=1761589011\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4121600/extras/7fb159fcf9d71f07a19599c8b96c68ec.webm?t=1761589011\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4121600/extras/7fb159fcf9d71f07a19599c8b96c68ec.mp4?t=1761589011\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore <strong>Massive Mega-Structures</strong>, discover their purpose and destroy them all!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Encounter <strong>Bizarre Monsters</strong>, fight them back!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wander a darkly fantastical and dangerous world, with secrets at every turn!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make friends with <strong>Strange Creatures,</strong> and gain their aid in your quest!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Use Your Senses: LOOK</strong>, <strong>TOUCH</strong>, <strong>TALK</strong>, and <strong>FIGHT</strong> with the world to gain insight into it!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover <strong>the truth</strong> of the world!\u00a0</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4121600/extras/64c1eb0704ca5484d46a69d9e2f29b68.poster.avif?t=1761589011\" width=302 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4121600/extras/64c1eb0704ca5484d46a69d9e2f29b68.webm?t=1761589011\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br><br><br><br></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4121600?t=1761589011","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4121600/2ba7abeef6b5840104b76d01f846f481d7012d6b/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1761589011","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4121600/4246bcd405c04daedee6da8c56babdea3ff27792/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761589011","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4121600/4246bcd405c04daedee6da8c56babdea3ff27792/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761589011","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"Psychopomp 2 contains grotesque monsters and disturbing scenes. Sounds a